WEBVTT

00:15.181 --> 00:16.808
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

02:54.591 --> 02:56.301
You must never...

02:57.135 --> 02:58.887
look inside His Majesty's bedchamber.

02:59.512 --> 03:00.597
Do you understand?

03:02.182 --> 03:03.683
Yes, my lord.

05:53.102 --> 05:56.981
THE KING IS DEAD. A NEW WIND WILL BLOW.

06:05.114 --> 06:06.949
- We deserve to die!
- We deserve to die!

06:07.450 --> 06:09.994
Over 100 of the same notice were posted

06:10.078 --> 06:11.829
all over Hanyang last night.

06:12.580 --> 06:14.665
His Majesty, who is very much alive,

06:15.041 --> 06:16.417
has perished?

06:24.509 --> 06:26.052
Capture everyone who posted these,

06:26.135 --> 06:27.428
wrote these,

06:27.512 --> 06:28.971
or gave instructions to write these.

06:29.055 --> 06:31.182
Bring in every single one of them.

06:31.682 --> 06:33.393
I shall annihilate their entire families.

06:38.731 --> 06:40.024
The same goes for...

06:41.275 --> 06:44.404
those who did nothing
while these notices went up

06:45.988 --> 06:46.906
throughout the capital.

06:46.989 --> 06:49.242
My lord, please spare my life.

06:49.325 --> 06:51.160
My lord, please!

06:51.244 --> 06:52.995
Forgive me, my lord.

06:53.704 --> 06:54.705
- Please, my lord!
- My lord!

06:54.789 --> 06:56.249
Please spare my life!

07:04.132 --> 07:07.260
The Haewon Cho Clan
is rounding up young scholars.

07:11.013 --> 07:12.932
Goodness. Oh, my! What are you doing?

07:13.015 --> 07:15.268
No! Gyeong-seok!

07:15.351 --> 07:17.186
Gyeong-seok! Goodness!

07:17.270 --> 07:19.272
Gyeong-seok!

07:25.945 --> 07:27.155
Arrest them!

07:34.328 --> 07:37.457
Ten days have passed
since His Majesty fell ill with smallpox.

07:37.832 --> 07:41.502
The only two people who had seen
His Majesty during the past ten days

07:41.586 --> 07:44.505
are Chief State Councilor Cho Hak-ju
and his daughter, the second Queen.

07:45.006 --> 07:47.383
No wonder those terrible rumors

07:47.467 --> 07:49.844
of His Majesty passing away have spread.

08:07.445 --> 08:08.529
Halt!

08:10.948 --> 08:15.953
We received a report that 89 scholars
from institutions near Hanyang

08:16.037 --> 08:18.581
worked together to post
these heinous notices.

08:18.664 --> 08:20.249
Confess!

08:20.333 --> 08:24.670
The first to confess
will have his life spared!

08:24.837 --> 08:28.257
Who are the real traitors of this nation?

08:28.341 --> 08:31.219
Through the spoils system and extortion,

08:32.470 --> 08:37.266
the evil family of the Queen
is busy feeding themselves.

08:38.309 --> 08:39.435
The traitors?

08:41.687 --> 08:43.731
Look to the Haewon Cho Clan!

08:43.814 --> 08:46.150
How dare you! Shut your mouth!

08:46.234 --> 08:48.444
Those of the Haewon Cho Clan
are but insects

08:49.695 --> 08:51.822
that are sucking the blood of the people.

08:52.532 --> 08:55.535
How do they differ from swine
that eat feces?

08:55.618 --> 08:58.579
Perhaps it is better
for His Majesty to be dead.

08:58.996 --> 09:01.916
He is a feeble king who handed the nation

09:02.375 --> 09:05.878
over to Lord Cho Hak-ju,
the head of those swine!

09:05.962 --> 09:07.129
How dare you!

09:07.755 --> 09:11.050
Did you say it is better
for His Majesty to be dead?

09:11.425 --> 09:13.427
Do you admit to treason?

09:27.233 --> 09:29.402
Then to whom are you referring
by "new wind"?

09:29.944 --> 09:33.030
Who is the new king you wish to serve?

09:34.240 --> 09:37.285
Is it the Crown Prince?

09:38.369 --> 09:40.413
TONGMYEONGJEON

10:11.861 --> 10:12.862
Your Royal Highness.

10:13.696 --> 10:15.865
You have been at my chambers for days

10:15.948 --> 10:18.492
even though I am not fit to move.

10:19.076 --> 10:21.787
Father has been ill for ten days,

10:22.705 --> 10:24.915
but there is nothing I can do for him.

10:25.958 --> 10:28.461
It devastates me that I cannot fulfill
my duties as his son.

10:30.755 --> 10:33.257
Please permit me to enter
the King's palace

10:33.758 --> 10:35.760
and to stay by Father's side.

10:35.843 --> 10:38.471
Your father is lying ill from smallpox.

10:38.554 --> 10:42.391
If you catch it from him and fall ill
while looking after His Majesty,

10:42.475 --> 10:44.769
who will lead this nation?

10:44.852 --> 10:47.605
As a senior member of the royal family,
I can never permit it,

10:48.189 --> 10:49.565
so please leave.

10:52.109 --> 10:53.903
Then just tell me this.

10:56.614 --> 10:58.157
Is Father...

10:58.991 --> 11:00.409
truly alive?

11:09.168 --> 11:13.673
You may have learned
how to be filial toward your father,

11:14.298 --> 11:16.842
but not toward your mother.

11:17.176 --> 11:20.554
How could you be so disobedient
to me in front of the servants?

11:20.638 --> 11:22.723
Do you hate me that much?

11:24.266 --> 11:28.104
Or is that hatred more toward...

11:30.064 --> 11:31.899
your unborn sibling?

11:33.317 --> 11:35.277
Your Majesty, how dare I...

11:35.361 --> 11:36.487
If that is not the case,

11:38.155 --> 11:39.490
please head back.

11:41.784 --> 11:44.203
What are you waiting for?
Escort the Crown Prince.

12:10.855 --> 12:12.898
I must see my father.

12:13.858 --> 12:15.401
I will go to the King's palace.

12:19.071 --> 12:20.990
Your Royal Highness, have you forgotten?

12:21.073 --> 12:25.077
The Queen ordered that Your Royal Highness
be kept out of the King's palace.

12:25.161 --> 12:26.078
Step aside.

12:27.288 --> 12:28.706
I said to step aside!

12:31.208 --> 12:32.418
Please be understanding.

12:33.002 --> 12:34.503
Whom do you serve?

12:36.338 --> 12:38.048
Whom do you consider
the King of this nation?

12:38.758 --> 12:40.801
Is it my father or the Haewon Cho Clan?

12:41.719 --> 12:44.013
Is there anyone in the entire palace

12:44.680 --> 12:47.892
who does not follow the orders
of the Haewon Cho Clan?

12:48.350 --> 12:49.643
Your Royal Highness.

12:50.269 --> 12:52.480
- Please be understanding!
- Please be understanding!

12:57.777 --> 12:59.153
Call Mu-yeong.

13:24.637 --> 13:25.930
Your Royal Highness.

13:42.488 --> 13:45.866
Why would you throw something
worth more than my year's salary?

13:48.577 --> 13:50.704
If a tantrum is what you wanted to throw,

13:51.664 --> 13:53.916
you should have aimed it at the Queen.

13:53.999 --> 13:56.418
The greatest virtue a crown prince
must pursue is filial piety.

13:56.961 --> 13:59.630
I cannot ignore the virtue
and risk being deposed.

14:00.005 --> 14:02.424
The wench may be barely of age,

14:03.092 --> 14:04.802
but she is my mother nonetheless.

14:04.885 --> 14:05.928
I see.

14:06.679 --> 14:08.681
Your Royal Highness
is a truly devoted son.

14:08.764 --> 14:10.432
I have a job for you.

14:16.063 --> 14:16.939
Is it...

14:18.607 --> 14:22.194
Is it to go to the King's palace
and see His Majesty?

14:23.237 --> 14:25.114
Bring me the journal
kept at the Royal Infirmary.

14:25.197 --> 14:28.742
The palace guards keep an eye
on the journal day and night.

14:28.951 --> 14:30.703
How can I possibly obtain it?

14:30.786 --> 14:34.123
The pears from Naju,
the pomegranates from Gochang,

14:34.206 --> 14:37.084
and the ginger sweets
prepared with care by the Royal Kitchen...

14:39.128 --> 14:41.589
Did you forget all that you stole from me?

14:41.672 --> 14:42.923
Your Royal Highness.

14:43.007 --> 14:44.592
Think of your wife, who supported you

14:44.675 --> 14:46.427
until you finally passed
the state examination

14:46.510 --> 14:47.803
at the age of 40.

14:49.430 --> 14:53.017
You stole from my dessert table
in order to bring them to your kind wife

14:53.601 --> 14:55.019
who finally got pregnant

14:55.102 --> 14:56.979
after ten years of marriage, did you not?

14:57.062 --> 14:59.189
Your Royal Highness,
you know of my situation.

15:00.149 --> 15:02.484
How long are you planning to use that
against me?

15:04.361 --> 15:06.614
If they find out
that you stole from my dessert table,

15:08.032 --> 15:09.116
you will be fired.

15:09.199 --> 15:12.119
I will be so if I get caught
stealing the journal.

15:12.202 --> 15:13.579
I see.

15:15.080 --> 15:17.833
I hear tonight's dessert table
will have beef pancakes.

15:20.252 --> 15:23.172
I guess I cannot force you.

15:30.471 --> 15:33.849
If I try to sneak in before sunrise
when the guards change shifts,

15:35.267 --> 15:37.019
I may be able to get the journal.

15:42.650 --> 15:46.070
The guards will not be
as frosty before sunrise.

15:46.403 --> 15:49.490
I may be able to get it
if I sneak in during the shift change.

17:24.084 --> 17:25.586
His Majesty went missing?

17:25.836 --> 17:27.171
Forgive me.

17:27.254 --> 17:29.006
I only stepped away for a moment--

17:29.131 --> 17:31.008
If you wish to live, you must find him.

17:31.508 --> 17:32.342
Now!

17:37.389 --> 17:39.058
Father is...

17:39.850 --> 17:40.934
missing?

20:03.744 --> 20:05.662
What are you doing here,
Your Royal Highness?

20:08.415 --> 20:09.374
There was...

20:10.375 --> 20:11.752
something monstrous in the hallway.

20:12.336 --> 20:13.420
Something monstrous?

20:14.004 --> 20:15.339
It sounded like a beast.

20:16.673 --> 20:19.009
It smelled of blood and had a foul stench.

20:19.885 --> 20:22.846
It was not human.
It had the shape of a monster.

20:23.555 --> 20:24.932
That cannot be true.

20:25.641 --> 20:27.309
A monster in the King's palace?

20:28.101 --> 20:29.519
Your Royal Highness must be wrong.

20:29.603 --> 20:31.271
You do not believe me?

20:31.355 --> 20:35.108
Your Royal Highness must be weak
from having knelt in contrition for days.

20:35.692 --> 20:37.486
Please return to your chambers

20:37.569 --> 20:41.198
and have a physician check up on you.

20:42.407 --> 20:44.618
Have His Royal Highness's attendants
escort him.

20:59.174 --> 21:00.509
Did you find my father?

21:01.093 --> 21:02.970
What do you mean?

21:06.473 --> 21:07.516
His Majesty...

21:08.850 --> 21:10.894
is lying in his bed at this very moment.

21:11.478 --> 21:13.021
He is lying in his bed?

21:15.482 --> 21:18.360
I shall simply check for myself then.

21:22.572 --> 21:25.158
Your Royal Highness, please stop.

21:25.242 --> 21:27.077
Father, it is Chang.

21:27.369 --> 21:28.745
Please stop, Your Royal Highness.

21:28.829 --> 21:30.122
- Open the door.
- No!

21:30.205 --> 21:31.581
Open it at once!

21:37.379 --> 21:39.339
You dare draw

21:40.424 --> 21:42.009
your sword at me?

21:42.592 --> 21:44.594
It is the Queen's orders.

21:45.053 --> 21:46.972
I am only maintaining the laws
of the palace.

21:47.055 --> 21:49.099
Can a mere commander of the Royal Army

21:50.100 --> 21:52.144
shed the blood of the royal family?

21:55.522 --> 21:56.857
If you can,

21:59.359 --> 22:00.444
strike me.

22:13.874 --> 22:15.709
Where is my father?

22:17.377 --> 22:18.253
Why?

22:18.837 --> 22:21.673
Are you concerned
about your father's safety?

22:22.090 --> 22:23.300
I saw...

22:24.926 --> 22:27.429
a hideous monster
inside the King's palace.

22:28.680 --> 22:30.223
I saw one as well.

22:38.315 --> 22:41.610
A son pretending
to be concerned about his father

22:42.069 --> 22:45.906
when he secretly wishes
for his father to die

22:46.782 --> 22:49.284
so that he can secure safety
and power for himself.

22:49.951 --> 22:52.371
That is the monster I saw.

22:53.372 --> 22:54.623
Not only that,

22:54.706 --> 22:56.583
but I saw monsters

22:57.209 --> 22:58.710
full of evil thoughts

22:59.544 --> 23:02.881
who intend to use that son
to slay His Majesty

23:02.964 --> 23:04.633
and take over this nation.

23:04.758 --> 23:06.635
Those monsters' blood
is filling the courtyard

23:06.718 --> 23:08.929
of the Royal Investigation Bureau.

23:09.221 --> 23:12.808
Once that blood overflows,
the leader of the conspiracy,

23:14.851 --> 23:19.064
the new king they wish to place
on the throne, will be identified.

23:20.315 --> 23:21.441
When the time comes,

23:22.734 --> 23:25.112
even a mere commander of the Royal Army

23:25.821 --> 23:28.407
may shed the blood of the royal family.

23:30.992 --> 23:35.038
Your Royal Highness may continue to wait,
but His Majesty will not return.

23:35.122 --> 23:39.084
His illness subsided,
so he went to the Queen's palace.

23:41.670 --> 23:42.712
Beom-il,

23:44.214 --> 23:45.924
escort His Royal Highness out.

23:46.716 --> 23:47.968
Yes, Father.

24:18.415 --> 24:21.418
His Royal Highness
must have been startled.

24:21.501 --> 24:23.628
Bring him some medicine
to calm his nerves.

24:39.811 --> 24:40.812
Your Royal Highness.

24:43.106 --> 24:44.316
Did you retrieve it?

24:45.025 --> 24:45.859
Yes.

24:45.942 --> 24:49.321
I almost got caught,
but I managed to sneak it out.

24:55.327 --> 24:57.704
Father collapsed ten days ago,

24:58.288 --> 24:59.498
at the end of the month.

25:04.294 --> 25:07.172
"Chills, fever,

25:07.839 --> 25:08.882
and a headache.

25:10.800 --> 25:14.179
Administered the decoction for rashes
numerous times, but it was ineffective.

25:16.556 --> 25:19.309
The fever is too high to be varicella.

25:21.228 --> 25:23.104
The symptoms are severe.

25:25.732 --> 25:27.108
There might not be a cure."

25:29.402 --> 25:30.529
Your Royal Highness,

25:30.612 --> 25:32.364
why are there no more entries?

25:32.447 --> 25:33.615
This cannot be.

25:34.241 --> 25:37.536
Those in the Royal Infirmary must write
an entry every day without fail.

25:38.995 --> 25:41.706
Furthermore,
Father was in critical condition.

25:47.879 --> 25:49.631
Unless they had to hide something

25:51.383 --> 25:53.593
and intentionally omitted entries...

25:56.846 --> 25:59.599
What is happening to my father right now

26:00.642 --> 26:02.602
in his own palace?

26:04.521 --> 26:05.522
Your Royal Highness.

26:08.733 --> 26:10.527
Who is Physician Lee Seung-hui?

26:12.904 --> 26:16.032
He was a royal physician,
but he resigned three years ago.

26:16.908 --> 26:18.201
How do you know of him?

26:19.160 --> 26:22.664
His name is written on the last entry
regarding His Majesty.

26:25.000 --> 26:28.169
PHYSICIAN LEE SEUNG-HUI OF JIYULHEON
IN DONGNAE WAS CALLED INTO THE PALACE

26:32.507 --> 26:33.883
I must go out in disguise.

26:34.426 --> 26:36.720
Pardon? In disguise?

26:37.137 --> 26:40.348
You cannot. Who knows
what the Queen will do to you--

26:40.432 --> 26:42.350
She said not to enter the King's palace.

26:42.767 --> 26:44.769
She did not forbid me
from leaving the palace.

26:45.020 --> 26:46.271
Your Royal Highness!

26:46.688 --> 26:47.856
Prepare to leave.

26:48.607 --> 26:51.026
It will be just you and me.

26:52.485 --> 26:53.737
Then what about...

26:54.946 --> 26:56.323
the beef pancakes?

27:04.289 --> 27:07.959
DONGNAE

27:09.502 --> 27:14.549
JIYULHEON

27:28.021 --> 27:31.733
Eat a little more.
You will recover faster that way.

27:31.816 --> 27:33.485
I will have it later.

27:35.403 --> 27:36.863
You call that food?

27:37.781 --> 27:41.201
They will croak from starvation
before the disease kills them.

27:44.329 --> 27:48.041
The government promised
to send us some rice soon,

27:48.124 --> 27:49.751
so wait until then.

27:49.834 --> 27:51.378
Like they would.

27:52.003 --> 27:53.755
Dozens of people die every day

27:53.838 --> 27:56.132
waiting for that rice.

28:00.595 --> 28:01.930
You should rest.

28:21.282 --> 28:22.826
What are you doing?

28:23.410 --> 28:27.163
Those people will become sicker
if they do not eat that,

28:27.622 --> 28:28.998
so watch what you say.

28:39.217 --> 28:40.719
By the way,

28:40.802 --> 28:42.721
when is that Physician Lee coming?

28:42.804 --> 28:45.056
I told you he went to Hanyang.

28:45.181 --> 28:47.183
So, when is he coming back?

28:47.267 --> 28:49.686
I came all the way here
because I heard he was the best.

28:51.229 --> 28:52.480
Your wound will heal quickly

28:53.690 --> 28:56.317
if you shut your trap,

28:57.068 --> 28:58.486
so be on your way.

29:00.572 --> 29:01.614
What did you just...

29:03.408 --> 29:04.701
What the...

29:08.705 --> 29:09.914
What are you looking at?

29:21.050 --> 29:23.762
The medicine is ineffective
since they cannot eat much.

29:24.345 --> 29:25.472
This is bad.

29:27.015 --> 29:29.058
- Physician Lee has returned!
- Hurry!

29:29.225 --> 29:30.477
Physician Lee is back!

29:34.981 --> 29:36.316
There he is!

30:01.090 --> 30:02.383
Welcome back, Master.

30:06.513 --> 30:09.390
What is that, Master?

30:16.439 --> 30:17.732
Prepare for a funeral.

30:18.858 --> 30:19.818
Pardon?

30:20.276 --> 30:22.821
Whose funeral do you mean?

30:30.787 --> 30:31.830
Over here.

30:34.624 --> 30:36.584
Help me with this.

30:39.379 --> 30:40.547
Let's open it.

30:48.805 --> 30:49.931
- My gosh, Dan-i.
- It is Dan-i!

30:50.014 --> 30:51.850
- Oh, my. Dan-i!
- My goodness.

30:51.933 --> 30:53.393
- What happened?
- What happened to him?

30:55.645 --> 30:57.647
- Oh, my.
- Dan-i...

30:58.189 --> 30:59.566
What happened to Dan-i?

31:00.191 --> 31:01.442
How could this happen to him?

31:04.904 --> 31:06.239
Master!

31:06.489 --> 31:10.159
Master, what happened? Please tell me!

31:10.702 --> 31:13.454
What happened in Hanyang

31:14.205 --> 31:17.208
that Dan-i returned
in such a gruesome state?

31:19.168 --> 31:20.837
Please tell me, Master.

31:27.760 --> 31:29.095
Nothing happened.

31:30.889 --> 31:32.015
Nothing.

31:33.933 --> 31:35.268
Nothing happened.

31:45.862 --> 31:47.864
HANYANG

31:47.989 --> 31:49.782
It says they will depose His Majesty,

31:49.866 --> 31:52.660
have the Crown Prince take the throne,

31:53.369 --> 31:56.372
and create a new world.

31:57.373 --> 32:00.960
This is conclusive evidence of treason.

32:02.128 --> 32:05.256
We must bring the Crown Prince
to the Royal Investigation Bureau

32:05.340 --> 32:07.300
and interrogate him right away.

32:07.383 --> 32:12.013
Where and how did you find the letter?

32:12.597 --> 32:15.099
Someone reported that one of the scholars

32:15.183 --> 32:17.977
who was arrested had this letter at home.

32:18.061 --> 32:20.271
What a useful informant.

32:20.355 --> 32:24.400
He knew every single one
of the 89 scholars who committed treason

32:24.484 --> 32:27.695
and where the secret letter
that no one knew about was kept.

32:28.613 --> 32:30.365
Who is this informant?

32:30.865 --> 32:33.284
Why is that important?

32:36.287 --> 32:40.541
None of the 89 scholars
admitted to the allegation of treason.

32:40.625 --> 32:41.584
Yet,

32:42.377 --> 32:45.630
you are accusing them of treason based on
the statement of that single informant.

32:46.506 --> 32:48.883
This is an insult
to the Confucian scholars,

32:48.967 --> 32:50.176
the foundation of this nation.

32:53.096 --> 32:57.058
Are the Confucian scholars
really the foundation of this nation?

32:58.768 --> 33:00.061
What did those Confucian scholars

33:01.270 --> 33:03.606
ever do for this nation?

33:03.690 --> 33:04.816
What are you saying?

33:07.402 --> 33:09.445
Two disastrous wars

33:10.655 --> 33:12.824
swept through this land.

33:14.659 --> 33:15.952
Do you know...

33:16.661 --> 33:19.539
why we were defeated so helplessly?

33:21.416 --> 33:23.251
It is because weak Confucian scholars,

33:23.918 --> 33:26.337
who only blabbed of the Analects
and Mencius

33:26.671 --> 33:29.298
without taking any action,
led this nation.

33:30.508 --> 33:32.135
The same holds true today.

33:32.218 --> 33:34.887
You are completely out of line,
Chief State Councilor.

33:37.306 --> 33:39.100
What do you think you are doing?

33:39.183 --> 33:40.601
Can you not see?

33:41.936 --> 33:43.563
Should I help you see it better?

33:45.648 --> 33:48.901
Now do you see what it says?

33:48.985 --> 33:51.487
It says they will tear down the King,

33:51.946 --> 33:53.740
disturb the order,

33:53.823 --> 33:57.118
and create chaos,
thus leading this nation to ruin.

33:57.201 --> 33:58.911
After reading such a horrendous letter,

33:58.995 --> 34:02.915
should the members of the Court
sit around and argue about

34:02.999 --> 34:07.378
what should be done while doing nothing
as they did during those wars?

34:07.920 --> 34:09.005
Lord Cho,

34:09.922 --> 34:11.215
that is enough.

34:22.727 --> 34:26.522
Arrest the Crown Prince and bring him
to the Royal Investigation Bureau.

34:37.033 --> 34:38.367
Where is the Crown Prince?

34:38.910 --> 34:40.203
We do not know.

34:45.666 --> 34:49.587
Give me the same answer again,
and you will lose your neck.

34:51.672 --> 34:53.257
Where is the Crown Prince?

34:54.383 --> 34:57.512
- I truly do not--
- If I may answer,

34:57.804 --> 35:00.139
we have been searching for him all day,

35:00.223 --> 35:02.725
but he is nowhere
within the Crown Prince's palace.

35:03.267 --> 35:05.103
You saw for yourself, did you not?

35:08.314 --> 35:09.190
Find the Crown Prince!

35:09.273 --> 35:11.275
Search all over the palace and Hanyang

35:11.359 --> 35:13.194
and drag him
to the Royal Investigation Bureau.

35:14.362 --> 35:15.947
The Crown Prince is no longer...

35:17.073 --> 35:18.950
the heir to the throne.

35:19.367 --> 35:21.661
He is a criminal who conspired treason.

35:48.938 --> 35:51.023
Gosh.

35:56.279 --> 35:57.155
Is anyone there?

36:02.994 --> 36:03.911
It is taking a bath.

36:07.957 --> 36:09.208
Is anyone there?

36:09.292 --> 36:10.334
Sure, sure.

36:11.043 --> 36:12.587
Are you Park Jong-yeong,

36:12.670 --> 36:15.548
- an orderly at the Royal Infirmary?
- Yes, I am.

36:18.259 --> 36:22.597
What brings
the Crown Prince's personal guard by?

36:22.680 --> 36:25.141
I am looking for Physician Lee Seung-hui
from Dongnae.

36:25.474 --> 36:26.809
He entered the palace

36:26.893 --> 36:29.020
on the third of the month
when you were on duty.

36:29.645 --> 36:32.190
I do not know his name,

36:32.273 --> 36:35.526
but the physician from Dongnae
has left already.

36:35.902 --> 36:37.778
The lad who came with him
got severely ill,

36:37.862 --> 36:39.405
so they had to return.

36:41.365 --> 36:42.617
Ask what his symptoms were like.

36:45.203 --> 36:47.330
Why was the lad in critical condition?

36:48.122 --> 36:49.207
Did he catch smallpox?

36:49.957 --> 36:52.835
A dullard like me does not know for sure,

36:53.252 --> 36:54.921
but it was not a disease.

36:55.004 --> 36:57.089
He had deep wounds all over his body.

36:57.924 --> 37:02.220
It looked as if he was bitten
by a huge beast.

37:11.479 --> 37:14.273
Your Royal Highness, we must hurry.

37:14.774 --> 37:16.984
We will get caught at this rate.
We must hurry back.

37:17.985 --> 37:21.656
That way is south,
so Dongnae must be in that direction.

37:23.032 --> 37:24.659
I need to know

37:25.243 --> 37:28.037
what happened to my father
and to the royal family

37:29.121 --> 37:30.665
of this nation.

37:30.748 --> 37:32.166
What do you mean?

37:33.292 --> 37:34.418
I must go to Dongnae.

37:35.002 --> 37:36.087
To Dongnae?

37:37.630 --> 37:38.464
Now?

37:41.884 --> 37:45.054
Without eunuchs or court ladies
to serve you?

37:45.137 --> 37:46.806
You and I alone?

37:47.223 --> 37:48.182
We cannot.

37:48.266 --> 37:49.600
I shall go.

37:49.684 --> 37:52.603
Do you know how far it is
from Hanyang to Dongnae?

37:53.646 --> 37:55.022
You almost vomited several times

37:55.106 --> 37:57.066
on the way here from the palace

37:57.149 --> 37:58.693
because of the stench.

37:58.776 --> 38:00.861
How can you make it all the way to Dongnae

38:01.487 --> 38:04.699
on such rough and difficult roads?
It is nearly 350km away.

38:04.782 --> 38:08.494
My life until now has been more difficult
than that.

38:08.577 --> 38:10.079
What about your meals?

38:10.871 --> 38:13.916
You will not even get to see
the delicacies you enjoy in the palace.

38:14.000 --> 38:15.084
I do not care.

38:15.167 --> 38:17.420
We could encounter bandits or rioters.

38:18.045 --> 38:19.297
They might kill us.

38:20.006 --> 38:21.590
I will die anyway...

38:22.758 --> 38:24.010
if I remain here.

38:24.093 --> 38:26.137
Because of the allegation of treason?

38:26.846 --> 38:29.724
Your Royal Highness,
even the Haewon Cho Clan

38:29.807 --> 38:32.893
cannot harm you
for something you did not do.

38:35.521 --> 38:36.605
I did it.

38:37.648 --> 38:38.649
Pardon?

38:40.526 --> 38:41.610
May I beg your pardon?

38:41.694 --> 38:42.611
I...

38:44.030 --> 38:45.531
conspired treason against Father.

38:47.908 --> 38:49.035
Why?

38:51.162 --> 38:51.996
How...

38:53.497 --> 38:57.376
You are the Crown Prince.
The throne would have been yours anyway.

38:57.460 --> 38:58.669
So why?

38:59.170 --> 39:03.049
IT HAS ITS MEANING IN CREATING A NEW WORLD

39:07.345 --> 39:10.848
LEE CHANG

39:24.653 --> 39:26.030
Crown Prince...

39:27.448 --> 39:28.491
That is correct.

39:29.784 --> 39:31.660
I am the Crown Prince of this nation.

39:33.371 --> 39:35.164
I am my father's only son,

39:35.664 --> 39:38.459
but I shall die if the Queen
gives birth to a legitimate son.

39:39.043 --> 39:41.712
I am but an illegitimate Crown Prince
born of a concubine.

39:43.714 --> 39:45.174
That was why.

39:45.883 --> 39:47.301
Because I wanted to live.

39:52.640 --> 39:55.059
- Still--
- I still feel the same way.

39:56.477 --> 40:00.106
Many scholars are dying at the Royal
Investigation Bureau to protect me.

40:00.189 --> 40:02.274
The only way to save them and myself...

40:03.567 --> 40:05.444
is in the south, in Dongnae.

40:06.737 --> 40:09.031
I must go to Dongnae,
meet Physician Lee Seung-hui,

40:10.116 --> 40:12.076
and find out

40:12.743 --> 40:14.203
what happened to my father.

40:36.225 --> 40:37.977
All I said was that he took the lad home

40:38.727 --> 40:41.647
because he was in critical condition.

40:41.730 --> 40:45.401
Forgive me, my lord!

40:45.609 --> 40:46.610
I am sure

40:47.361 --> 40:50.030
the Crown Prince went to Dongnae
in search of Physician Lee.

40:50.114 --> 40:52.408
I told you before, did I not?

40:53.117 --> 40:55.453
We should have silenced Lee Seung-hui
by killing him.

40:57.746 --> 40:58.956
Physician Lee...

41:00.166 --> 41:02.293
is still valuable to us.

41:02.376 --> 41:03.335
However,

41:05.129 --> 41:06.672
the Crown Prince is not.

41:17.057 --> 41:20.352
Our messengers will not arrive
ahead of the Crown Prince.

41:21.353 --> 41:24.398
You must go and stop him yourselves.

41:25.107 --> 41:28.194
A cavalry of ten on speedy horses
will head out first,

41:28.652 --> 41:32.239
and 50 competent soldiers
of the Royal Army shall follow.

41:33.032 --> 41:34.366
You must stop him

41:34.783 --> 41:36.410
before he reaches Dongnae

41:36.994 --> 41:38.579
and Jiyulheon.

41:39.246 --> 41:41.457
Even if it means you have to kill him.

41:42.124 --> 41:45.294
HANYANG, DONGNAE

41:46.003 --> 41:50.633
DONGNAE

42:06.065 --> 42:07.316
I cannot stop thinking about...

42:10.027 --> 42:11.070
the strange wounds

42:12.154 --> 42:13.572
on Dan-i's body.

42:19.328 --> 42:20.204
We shall go.

42:32.091 --> 42:33.842
I see smoke from the chimney.

42:36.845 --> 42:37.846
What is going on?

42:43.727 --> 42:45.354
It has been so long since I last had meat.

42:55.239 --> 42:56.490
I feel much better now.

42:57.116 --> 42:59.785
- This is so good!
- Can I have another bowl?

43:02.955 --> 43:04.415
This is so delicious.

43:04.498 --> 43:06.292
- What is that?
- This is unbelievably delicious!

43:28.606 --> 43:29.607
What is all this?

43:30.441 --> 43:32.026
Is it not obvious?

43:33.402 --> 43:35.404
The patients are starving to death,

43:36.447 --> 43:38.907
but the physician is holed up in his room.

43:40.492 --> 43:43.787
I needed food to live, so I hunted a deer.

43:43.871 --> 43:45.080
A deer?

43:46.248 --> 43:48.459
You found a deer in the mountains?

43:50.169 --> 43:51.962
Did you get the government's permission?

43:52.379 --> 43:54.798
Should we get permission to die too?

43:56.008 --> 43:58.385
People here complain even if I bring food.

44:21.575 --> 44:22.701
My lady.

44:22.785 --> 44:26.664
I am sorry to ask,
but could I have some more?

44:27.039 --> 44:29.958
My wife is trying to breastfeed the baby,
but is having trouble...

44:30.042 --> 44:31.794
- Sure.
- Thank you.

44:54.692 --> 44:56.860
It is all right. Do not cry.

45:51.832 --> 45:52.958
What?

45:54.710 --> 45:57.171
How could you do this?

45:57.963 --> 46:00.174
- How could you?
- What are you talking about?

46:00.716 --> 46:01.925
I saw it.

46:03.469 --> 46:04.553
I saw it.

46:06.722 --> 46:08.557
How could you do that to a person?

46:09.016 --> 46:10.309
How could you...

46:10.976 --> 46:13.520
He was like family to us.

46:13.604 --> 46:15.147
Who cares what he was to you?

46:17.649 --> 46:19.943
Once you die, you are nothing
but a slab of meat.

46:21.695 --> 46:23.197
Are you out of your mind?

46:24.907 --> 46:27.701
He was a person, just like us.

46:28.660 --> 46:30.204
How can a person

46:30.871 --> 46:33.749
- eat another person?
- So what?

46:36.794 --> 46:38.545
Should we all just starve to death

46:40.005 --> 46:42.257
arguing about what we ought to do
as human beings?

46:44.009 --> 46:45.052
If everyone lived that way,

46:45.135 --> 46:47.429
half the population of Dongnae
would have starved to death already.

46:47.846 --> 46:49.014
What do you mean?

46:49.515 --> 46:52.184
How do you think the people
in the south survived?

46:53.852 --> 46:55.938
Do you think His Majesty saved them?

46:56.021 --> 46:59.233
No. What saved them...

47:00.526 --> 47:03.445
were the flesh and bones of neighbors
who starved to death.

47:07.908 --> 47:09.117
That cannot be true.

47:10.202 --> 47:12.037
You live as you wish to live.

47:13.539 --> 47:15.874
I will do whatever I need to do
to stay alive.

47:19.086 --> 47:20.045
It is delicious.

47:24.383 --> 47:25.509
Jong-gu!

47:25.884 --> 47:26.885
Are you all right?

47:26.969 --> 47:28.428
What is it? What is wrong?

47:30.931 --> 47:32.182
Jong-gu!

47:33.559 --> 47:34.643
Jong-gu!

47:35.519 --> 47:36.436
Jong-gu!

47:37.855 --> 47:40.399
Jong-gu!

47:50.367 --> 47:52.327
Jong-gu!

47:58.500 --> 47:59.459
Jong-gu.

48:00.210 --> 48:01.295
Jong-gu!

48:38.165 --> 48:39.166
Master!

49:30.717 --> 49:31.843
Mister.

49:32.636 --> 49:33.637
Mister!

49:34.888 --> 49:36.223
Mister, hold on.

49:41.311 --> 49:42.145
Mister!

50:39.327 --> 50:40.620
Do you have anything more to say?

56:12.494 --> 56:14.496
Subtitle translation by Hye-lim Park
